<title>DENMARK: Hypotekbanken issues four pct 800 mln Dkk bond.</title>
<headline>Hypotekbanken issues four pct 800 mln Dkk bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken said on Friday it issued a four percent, six year 800 million Danish crown bond.</p>
<p>It said the bond would be listed on Copenhagen Stock Exchange on November 8, 1996 and gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
